1 |text this afternoon took the kids the movies and saw neil gaimans stardust and all can say wow rare that completely taken aback anything but this quite possibly the greatest fantasy movie have ever seen maybe even the best movie any kind and all neil gaiman fault sure could have been sucked the wonderful dialog which was smart flowed smoothly and made the characters completely believable could for days about the spectacular acting charlie cox perfect tristan claire daines brilliant yvaine and robert nero almost steals the movie the deeply the closet pirate captian shakespeare the pure joy brought about the humor which managed laugh our loud funny intelligent enough make the first shrek look like sitcom and blend perfectly with the rest the movie alone would have made this great movie special effects were near perfect true this was lotr star wars extravaganza but where they were use they were exactly what was called for not too much distract you from the movie itself and blended into the story perfectly then there the story what can say how often you come across story containing all the classic fairytale formula components that doesn just come off another cheap princess bride knockoff manages familiar and comfortable and yet completely new and refreshing the same time any one those things would have made this good movie all them combined make great movie but they pale comparison the rich enchanting world that those elements combine bring life well once again neil gaiman has done has driven another dagger into heart creating world fantasy that beautiful and enchanting that would almost anything live and only given short glimpse into didn want end wanted sucked through vortex the land stormhold and get meet tristan and yvaine person travel fields and valleys stroll through marketplaces and meet residents both dangerous and friendly and stay there forever feeling that have noticed whenever have read anything gaiman the sandman american gods coraline all left with deep sense sadness when finished reading them because was over could not see anything more into the worlds had created which seemed much more vibrant and alive than the one forced live and watching stardust was different the end sure that neil writing and this movie won have the same effect everyone but trust when say you will not regret the time money spent watching this movie easily one the top movies have ever seen and can guarantee that anyone all with soul will least like
