1 |text kay pollak 2004 heart warmer xc3 xa5 som himmelen heaven contains every stereotype swedish humanity and inhumanity yet manages crowd pleaser contains plenty ammunition for cynical critics continuity error spotters and for saccharine debunkers yet manages depict the colours life small community evocatively the film also runs the gamut proverbial messages about finding one own voice and just doing despite one fear without completely removing the lump from the throats the cynics its success crowd pleaser comes from two facts firstly small films about strangers bringing new life rural christian communities provide plenty scope for the exposure hypocrisy while the same time allowing repressed characters break out their hairshirts the same year and with similarly swedish breeze the queen sheba pearls did and babette feast also comes mind secondly any film about small communities taking the whole wide world will strike human chord our increasingly individual self focused and impersonalized world this film structural similarity with the likes the full monty brassed off calendar girls and clear day shows its indebtedness the formula but formula with life left yet and this seems because people need positive message films that evoke sense community almost spite themselves the stranger burned out maestro daniel dar xc3 xa9us quest for self rediscovery the town visits rather revisits unbeknownst the townsfolk the place his childhood was bullied mercilessly classmates here supposedly because was sensitive musician without aspiration drive truck here takes the job cantor choirmaster despite the usual suspicions artists and outsiders the place course populated wide range recognizable types whose character arcs can predicted the broken hearted fair haired girl beautiful she nearly glows the cellphone ringing local businessman the woman whose beauty lost amidst domestic abuse the steely pastor and his less austere wife who first seem right out ingmar bergman also present jealous uptight spinster siv check geriatric whose soul still sings check elderly couple who may have repressed desires for each other since kindergarten check obese person whose function point out should not laugh and say fatty check intellectually handicapped boy who proves able sing good check pollak film not all warm fuzzies however diverts from the let put show despite setbacks and moral opposition sub genre contains violence and ending that might well metaphor for dying after achieving creative nirvana the violence the film mostly function male anger and repression but never delves deeply into why the school bully who grows into wife beater like this similarly the small town pastor closely adheres the moralistic black wearing super protestant stereotype that his secret indulgence girlie magazines hardly surprising his repressions and hypocrisies are just there dangling unrelated psychological reality perhaps the unexplained photograph young boy lost son perhaps glimpsed once over his shoulder holds the secret perhaps these holes are functions the editing like several inconsistencies and continuity glitches that can spotted such siv unexplained reappearance the choir twice after moralistic outbursts fact none the hitches the film last very long and all seem resolved within scene apart from some awkward love scenes the film 127 minutes seldom drag but there feeling that things may have been left the cutting room floor the film remains solid three star fare despite the holes that can picked this simply because world technology focused flicks and materialistic self seeking any glimpse human community deep down welcome for anyone even the cynical
