d discipline indeed then there the subtext his abandonment twice fact representative the way our society tends toss infantrymen onto the rubbish heap society when they served their terms the unemployed are military our world his can only worse russell quickly picks the mantle mace responsibility his wife and child desperately need mission even one with such high likelihood his death then there the military subtext too the conflict between busey church and the hotshot from mekum mekum new men are faster stronger more accurate and aggressive any one them could pound todd into the ground but not about the tools you have how you use them incentivized todd given the freedom exercise his initiative and acting without the numbing effect perceived superiority utilizes ambush tactics and sneaky tricks cut swathe through the newer unit sent without support cover reconnaissance reminder that military power cannot make for failure leadership there are many other subtle themes when film shot and scripted minimally leaves plenty white space for your own interpretations take root watch soldier with open mind and see what teaches you
