ple the slow boil thriller and are kept the very edge our seats waiting for the tide turn when the penny does drop and pitt let loose play the maniacal bad guy the film shifts gears completely and the last twenty minutes don quite live rest the movie that said the action thick and fast and the resolution suitable cold the fight over but the scars will always there much the narration provided somewhat whiny pre files duchovony tad contrived course meant from the book the duchovony journalist character has written one could argue that the self conscious narration meant nod the kind sensationalised style which most journalists write the film largely success and certainly cut above the thrillers the past twenty years highly recommended but not for the weak stomach mind this film disturbing more than one level but then meant
