y teak and marble not overlooked are the wonderfully carved jalees grille work window and doorway borders evidently specified art directors mcmillan johnson and hal pereira and obviously made the cheaper labor the island such craftsmanship reveals the careful attention detail that these men sought for those immune the blandishments time place and architecture there always the allure miss taylor she marries man she doesn really know and tacitly wooed another man against the background described and under the overarching tyranny the legacy man deceased said not great literature nor even great film but great spectacle long before that term was debased the special effects extravaganzas today this one those films made seen the giant screen outdoor drive not the home arrange the largest screen see fully appreciate its fine camera work and scope
