1 |text agree with many the negative reviews posted here for reasons will into later but this miniseries powerful and convincing because the talented cast really captures the dark truth hitler world peter stormare perfect ernst rohm the brutal brownshirt leader each scene has with hitler explosive hitler evil dominates everyone but the thuggish primitive rohm and clearly digs rohm for just that reason the interplay between stormare and carlisle illuminates the way hitler relished rohm brutality but later sacrificed him for political reasons jena malone turns heartrending performance geli raubal hitler doomed niece and the victim his unspeakable perversions without revealing any the sexual filth directly jena malone plays out all the horror the slow extinction young girl spirit she uses her eyes and voice suggest all the horror that will visited millions the years come and she brilliant zoe telford very nearly matches jena malone with her portrayal eva braun eva clearly sick cruel and heartless but the same time almost pitiably dependent her adolph twisted tenderness the aborted lovemaking scene between them hinting the spine tingling truth hitler enormous self loathing both chilling and erotic liev schrieber gives deliciously weasel like performance putzi hanfstaengel the spineless man about town who seduced hitler promises wealth and power while brute like rohm simply loves the idea crushing skulls under his boots schrieber character one many germans who abhors nazi violence but can resist the quick and easy route money and power his weak willed fawning over hitler soon loses him the respect his wife played with style and sensuality the stunning and regal julianna margulies they provide true portrait marriage and betrayal these performances carry the mini series along easily overcoming occasional weaknesses the script there one exception regrettably matthew modine acting chops just aren snuff his noble lunk haid journalist ruins every scene has the viewer can hardly wait for rohm brown shirts stomp that smug righteous look off his ignorant corn pone low rent hollywood golden boy face but the story still works now regard the factual inaccuracies the script hitler perversions and cruelty are rendered vibrant compelling drama but the battlefield record corporal hitler badly distorted afraid the audience can handle the idea evil and courage the same person the writers make hitler look like whining coward who begged for iron cross anyone the kaiser army could get medal just whining about the movie makes look hitler were coward the trenches when was fearless soldier they also suggest his comrades despised him when reality was widely admired officers and enlisted men alike the depressing thing that the mini series succeeds well representing hitler monster honest ways but they just couldn resist the cheap shot all all however hitler rise evil soaring success highlighted powerful performances
