1 |text mal xc3 xa9fique example how horror film can effective with nothing more than well executed plot and lot heart its cast doesn have recognized names doesn have big budget and certainly lacks the visual effects aspect but compensates all that with intelligent and well written script effective cast and the vision director focused more telling the story than delivering cheap thrills eric valette may not well know name yet but with mal xc3 xa9fique his feature length debut proves the level contemporaries like jeunet gans aja the film the story four prisoners cell four different men with very different backgrounds but with one single goal get out carr xc3 xa8re xc3 xa9rald laroche gets imprisoned after being declared guilty multi millionaire fraud his cell mates the violent marcus clovis cornillac the intellectual lassalle philippe laudenbach and the mentally challenged xc3 xa2querette dimitri rataud are all convicted for murder and give carr xc3 xa8re cold welcome their personalities will clash carr xc3 xa8re discovers ancient book detailing how former prisoner escaped using black magic written alexandre charlo and franck magnier mal xc3 xa9fique great mix dark fantasy and horror way very reminiscent clive barker stories the movie strongest point the way builds the characters they are all have very complex and different personalities and lot the tension and suspense comes from their constant clash personalities the story supernatural element very well handled and overall gives the film the feeling reading gothic novel despite being movie about four men locked room the movie never gets boring tiresome and fact the isolation the group increases the feeling distrust claustrophobia and specially paranoia director eric valette makes great use atmosphere mood and his cast give life the plot despite its obvious lack budget has crafted brilliant film that feels original fresh and very attractive his subtle and effective camera work helps make the film dynamic despite its single location and the slow pace the film unfolds excellent create the heavy atmosphere isolation and distrust the movie bases its plot the very few displays special effects are very well done and valette trades quantity for quality the few but terrific scenes gore the characters are what make this film work and the cast definitely deserves some the credit xc3 xa9rald laroche excellent carr xc3 xa8re man first sight innocent but who hides dark past philippe laudenbach and dimitri rataud are very effective too specially rataud his very demanding role however clovis cornillac who steal the show with his performance marcus violent and disturbed man who deep inside only wants himself the characters are superbly developed and the cast makes the most them the movie terrific but not without its share flaws course the most notorious one its the low budget some the cgi effects are bit poor compared the effective make and prosthetics used other scenes however never too bad for probably the bad thing about mal xc3 xa9fique that seems lose some steam the end when focuses the supernatural black magic rather than the characters not too much bad thing but the ending may seem weak from that point view anyways mal xc3 xa9fique another one those great horror films coming out from france lately and one that deserves have more recognition valette definitely talent follow this modest albeit complex tale the supernatural prove enough his abilities personally this film new favorite
