hter found something live for now for the movie everything right about beautiful score artful cinematography great set design contrast between the two lifestyles the messy apt and the decorated mansions wonderful and heartfelt performances the whole cast with bette midler particular oscar worthy this film which much more significant and well made than you been led believe
