lowly running out water and food but never the less fighting true british style one bugundian resident quotes english and always were english and just because are english are fighting hard bugundians sentiment that soon echoed throughout the capital when the rest london learn the poor bugundians plight they all feel compelled chip and help them throwing food and supplies over the barbed wire blockades will whitehall who has fought off may invaders throughout the centuries finally brought knees this new batch foreigners especially these ones are english great tale and great fun throughout not missed
