1 |text once while film comes along that raises the bar for every other film its genre film this caliber will influence many films following its release for years come chinese ghost story falls this category arguably one the best horror films made during the 1980 possibly one the best ever made the filmmakers have crafted movie that appeals every horror fan the story engrossing and original the villains are appropriately menacing and frightening the sets are creepy and atmospheric there even little blood and gore satisfy the splatter fan the house but don let the horror label scare you off you not fan the genre this film easily fits into many different categories the screenwriter has deftly blended the drama comedy horror kung and romance genres into delicious deluxe cinematic pizza chinese ghost story beautiful epic love story told thankfully without the gratuitous nudity and explicit sex scenes that have ruined many hollywood love stories those put off the romantic elements the story can sit back and revel the fast paced swordplay and wire that not enough actors leslie cheung and provide enough humorous situations satiate your appetite for comedy this film offers something for every film fan director siu tung ching and producer tsui hark assembled truly amazing cast for this film leslie cheung proves that not only gifted actor but also talented singer and charming physical comedian cannot possibly think performer other than cheung who could have portrayed ling choi sin better except maybe chow yun fat joey wang enchanting lit seen the enslaved spirit who steals the heart cheung character her portrayal the title character truly haunting and memorable hilarious the cantankerous taoist who aids the young lovers technical level this film very impressive even today standards the direction superb wish that today hollywood executives would seek out talented artists like siu tung ching rather falling back the usual mtv video pepsi commercial directors the cinematography gorgeous you have commend any cinematographer who can make film look good when most its pivotal scenes take place the dead night the special effects make top notch fact most the creature effects this film blow away the shoddy cgi ghouls and goblins that have become commonplace modern horror films since its release chinese ghost story has spawned two worthy sequels full length animated movie and countless imitations none the films that followed copied were able capture the magic this classic however this film required viewing for any horror fan just anyone looking for great way spend minutes your time out
