-1 |text the choke aka axe the slasher produced supposedly straight dvd movie say supposedly because the title the movie does not have the brackets indicate that was made for dvd movie even though does have the appearance one the plot simple xc2 x96 band holding gig former meatpacking factory and they are killed one one think most would agree that the movie was never going masterpiece but this does not excuse the faults here even straight dvd movies such bachelor party massacre which has very low imdb rating have lot redeeming qualities and sometimes come off being one the called bad they good movies however the choke falls far short being either serious slasher such halloween being bad good movie such the nail gun massacre the movie does start off good with character killed using drill the blood effects were very cheesy but understandable given the very low budget but from there onwards downhill all the way there are many faults the choke that could spend all day talking about them but few obvious ones stand out and into them the aforementioned gig that the band holds seems start off with around people present but after the music stops there seems only around people left and yet they all meant locked the characters this movie are not likable all most the band members are aggressive foul mouthed morons just downright weird one really cares about what happens them and even their supposed friends forget about them when they been dispatched the highlight the movie the presence homeless man who seems regard the meatpacking factory some kind church seriously spouts some really funny lines for apparent reason but sadly even his presence can save the movie there are too many scenes people walking around and talking without any characterisation around minutes the film spent watching characters walk around talking characters disappear for long periods time without explanation other straight dvd movies such crocodile and grim weekend the characters spend lot time swearing each other aggressively without any provocation all there are plenty over the top outbursts mainly from the male characters and one nearly results full blown fight fact the format could said follows characters walk around murder takes place characters walk around murder takes place you get the idea the dialogue terrible and seems that few lines are spoken without the word being used perhaps this was meant funny but just comes off sad and more the point have all seen this done thousand times before usually much greater effect the movie totally devoid any suspense all the dead bodies serve provide the only indication that the characters are danger maniac running around loose and yet the characters just behave like total morons they make little attempt get out the factory find weapon with which protect themselves and much the time they don even pretend scared the same vein drive massacre the killer not seen the time the murders are being committed with the exception the final murder when the killer identity revealed random weapon appears out nowhere kill the victim question there one seen stalking the characters any time drive massacre this served make the film funny unintentionally course but here not funny all and another reviewer has pointed out the soundtrack includes music that very bad even for those who like punk rock the extras look uncomfortable dancing the score the end there music the beginning consists band sugarbabe wannabes singing some very bad song that completely unrelated the movie don misunderstand the points made this review this reviewer likes bad movies such the nail gun massacre and bachelor party massacre much the classics such halloween and friday the 13th but seems that the choke tried too hard fit into one those categories without fitting into either and even straight dvd movies this poor effort positive note the film does contain some fairly good gory murder scenes but when the surviving characters not take the situation seriously these scenes lose their importance quickly the intensity they provide disappears into oblivion fans the traditional 1980s movie slashers should take steps avoid this movie and fans the classics such halloween and friday the 13th should everything their power avoid
