1 |text walt disney cinderella takes story everybody familiar with and embellishes with humor and suspense while retaining the tale essential charm disney artists provide the film with appealing storybook look that emanates delectable fairy tale atmosphere beautifully conventionally animated the highlight being the captivating scene where the fairy godmother transforms pumpkin into majestic coach and cinderella rags gorgeous gown mack david hoffman and jerry livingston provide lovely songs like dream wish your heart makes and bibbidi bobbidi boo that enhance both the scenario and the characters even though cinderella story predictable provides such thrilling melodrama that one shares the concerns and anxieties the titular heroine and her animal friends both the wicked stepmother and her dreadful cat lucifer present formidable menace that threatens the dreams and aspirations cinderella and the mice this menace that provides the story with strong conflict that holds the viewers interest the film suspense however nicely balanced serene sweetness especially the musical numbers these segments that reveal the appealing personalities cinderella and her friends moving the viewers care for them overall walt disney cinderella wonderful family entertainment that has held remarkably well after half century
