e the rest the flick just bunch empty soulless characters with personality whatsoever running from the zombies now some cases this can prove fun the zombie make and zombie action actually good and fun and there lot gore and guts involved here get neither well there some inspired moments there like for example when some eagles get infected the gas and they start attacking people that was cool there also scene involving flying zombie head wich the way defies all logic and explanation and scene with zombies coming out the pool the abandoned hotel and munching off poor girls legs but aside from that the rest the flick just falls flat its ass endless upon endless scenes that don jack move the already non existent plot along that was main gripe with this flick the sets look unfinished and the art direction practically non existent hate when everything looks damn unfinished like movies but this one just really went even below that its closer level flick you ask the zombie make pure crap the zombies are all asian actors the movie was filmed the philippines you get bunch asian looking zombies but thats not big problem since they movie was set the phillipine islands anyway its the look the zombies that really sucks they all died with the same clothes for some reason and what passes for zombie make here bunch black make more like smudges their faces one two zombies had slightly more complex make but still wasn good enough impress its just bunch goo pointlessly splattered the actors faces not only this flick slowly paced but the zombies look like crap these are supposed dead folks anyhows for those expecting the usual coolness fulci flick don come expecting here cause this mostly somebody else flick and those two involved mattei and fragasso didn really put there heart and souls into fact when you see the extras the dvd you will see that when fragasso asked about his recollections and his feelings this here flick doesn even take seriously you can tell ashamed and many occasions