1 |text grew this classic western series and child always considered treat being allowed stay late sunday evenings watch bonanza still infinitely watchable runs the series chronicles the adventures the cartwright family who live ranch near virginia city nevada around the civil war era their ranch called the ponderosa run and defended the widowed father ben and his unmarried three sons adam hoss and little joe these three brothers have different mothers all whom have passed away years earlier the cartwrights are hard working prosperous and honourable family highly respected those parts the ponderosa large reaching its extremities requires lot horseback riding also trips away are often necessary order buy sell cattle and forth needless say few these excursions pass uneventfully although hospitable much the cartwrights energy must spent defending their ranch from interlopers protecting themselves from townsfolk jealous their prosperity and stellar reputation the cartwrights fair bit firing their guns the air and such but only shoot kill when deemed absolutely necessary they are involved various town affairs even the political life the nevada territory one the main assets the series the underlying warmth that always present despite occasional disagreements between ben and his three sons and despite frequent disagreements between the three brothers now one brother might beat another every now and then but generally has good reason for the time and his anger never lasts long the characters are all very well drawn ben portrayed successful and noble man great integrity the oldest son adam the most rational and suave the brothers left midway through the series the middle brother hoss gentle giant teddy bear who has insatiable appetite for food and little shy around the ladies the youngest little joe hot headed handsome charmer who contrast has quite way with women this trio brothers enjoy various romances but their love interests are typically killed off the end the episode else marriage proves impossible for whatever reason the actors are all stellar their roles including pernell roberts adam dan blocker hoss michael landon little joe and course lorne greene the principled family patriarch ben also love the ranch cook hop sing played victor sen yung this wonderful action packed western with great values the cartwrights are always the noble heroes and most the bad guys quite villainous only there were more programs like this vintage western these days
