d loving parents whose time with their children limited because the pressure supporting the family lanisha parents are divorced but she able visit her father doorman luxury apartment building and talk about music her mother comforting when lanisha learns that friend the neighborhood has committed suicide somewhat melodramatic plot point otherwise realistic film the summer winds down the girls drift apart and each decides different course there are big dramatic moments however only the sad recognition the inevitability change though not have blinders about the frustrations that may await them identify with their hopes and dreams without dwelling the negative our song emotionally satisfying film about growing the projects that refuses see life any terms other than possibility
