1 |text based actual mining disaster this early german talkie with english subtitles still remains one the most effective docu dramas ever filmed featuring many non professional actors kameradschaft gives chilling view the friendship that binds the mine workers regardless which side the french german border they may from deadly accident brings out the very best everyone nullifying any superiors orders fellow miner need will receive the help his comrades even threat great loss including life this film reminds the self sacrificing heroism shown the nyfd following the attacks putting aside any formal rules and regulations these men and women uniform knew only one cause save lives and find their fellow fire fighters more than years later kameradschaft still has the strong and timeless message friend need friend deed
