1 |text alan johnson don cheadle successful dentist who shares his practice with other business partners alan also has loving wife jada pinkett smith and has two daughter camille lache smith imani hakim also let his parents stay his huge apartment new york city but somehow feels that his life somewhat empty one ordinary day the city sees his old college roommate charlie fireman adam sandler which alan hasn seen charlie years when alan tries befriends with charlie again charlie lonely depressed man who hides his true feelings from people who cares for him since charlie unexpectedly loses his family plane crash they were one the planes september 2001 when alan nearly feels comfortable with charlie when alan mentions things his past charlie turns violent towards alan anyone who mentions his deceased family now alan tries help charlie and tries make his life little easier for himself but alan finds out making charlie talking about his true feelings more difficult than expected written and directed mike bender blankman indian summer the upside anger made wonderfully touching human drama that moments sadness truth and comedy well sandler offers impressive dramatic performance which sandler offers more his dramatic role than did paul thomas anderson punch drunk love cheadle excellent usual pinkett smith fine alan supportive wife liv tyler also good the young psychiatrist and saffron burrows quite good the beautiful odd lonely woman who has wild crush alan this film was sadly box office disappointment despite had some great reviews the cast are first rate here the writing director wonderful and russ alsobrook terrific widescreen cinematography the movie has great nyc locations which the film makes new york beautiful city look the picture dvd has sharp anamorphic widescreen transfer and good dolby digital surround sound dvd also jam session with sandler cheadle featurette photo montage and previews was expecting more for the dvd features like audio commentary track the director and deleted scenes reign over certainly one the best films that came out this year sure this movie looked great the big screen which sadly haven had chance see theater but also the kind movie that plays well dvd the film has good soundtrack well and has plenty familiar faces supporting roles and bit parts even the director has bit part byran sugarman who actor himself reign over one the most underrated pictures this year also the best sandler film taste since the wedding singer don miss widescreen out
