1 |text one the most important artistic movements the history cinema was without doubt german expressionism the highly atmospheric style film making developed during the 20s berlin classic movies like das cabinet des caligari 1920 and nosferatu eine symphonie des grauens 1922 were the most famous direct results this movement and while the movement didn have long life its enormous influence over cinema can still felt today specially the horror genre one the key figures this style would director paul wegener director 1920 der golem wie die welt kam his debut filmmaker seven years before the making that classic was already making experiments with expressionism film that early prototype german expressionism was incidentally another horror film der student von prag der student von prag the student prague the story balduin paul wegener student with the reputation being the best fencer prague but who always find himself with financial troubles one day balduin rescues the beautiful countess margit grete berger from drowning lake after her horse drop her accident balduin falls immediately love with her and tries see her again but soon discovers that have compete with her rich cousin graf von schwarzenberg lothar xc3 xb6rner who also wants marry her knowing that can offer her much balduin wishes wealthy and this where sorcerer named scapinelli john gottowt enters the scene scapinelli offers balduin infinite wealth exchange whatever finds his room balduin accepts the proposal only discover horror that what scapinelli wants his reflection the mirror loosely inspired edgar allan poe short story william wilson and the classic legend faust the story der student von prag was conceived german writer hanns heinz ewers master horror literature and one the first writers consider scriptwriting valid any other form literature written time where cinema germany was still being developed art form der student von prag shows real willingness actually use cinema tell fully developed story beyond camera trick series scenes like most the scriptwriters his time ewers screenplay still very influenced theater although der student von prag begins move away from that style while bit poor its character development specially the supporting characters ewers manages create interesting and complex protagonist the person balduin while der student von prag was paul wegener directorial debut and stellan rye second film filmmaker very clear that these two pioneers had very good idea what cinema could when done properly giving great use guido seeber cinematography the two young filmmakers create powerful gothic atmosphere that forecasts what the german filmmakers the following decade would wegener would learn many the techniques would employ his golem series from seeber and rye despite having very limited resources rye and wegener manage create amazing and very convincing for its time visual effect for the scenes with balduin reflection played wegener too already experienced stage actor the time making this film wegener directs the cast with great talent and also attempts move away from the stagy style previous filmmakers balduin paul wegener very effective and probably the best the movie certainly helps that his character the only one fully developed the writer but one can deny that wegener was very good his role the poor student who loses more than his mirror reflection that contract john gottowt plays the sinister scapinelli with mysterious aura that suits the character like glove few said about scapinelli the film but gottowt makes sure let know that force feared the rest the main cast less lucky with grete berger being pretty much average countess margit and lothar xc3 xb6rner making poor graf von schwarzenberg however must said that lyda salmonova was pretty good her expressive character and fritz weidemann made excellent baron waldis schwarzenberg showing the dignity that xc3 xb6rner character should have had considering the movies that were being done those years other countries and the fact that its remake made years after this film superior every possible way not difficult understand why der student von prag hasn stood the test time well other early films the movie main problem definitely its extremely low budget resulted the film being considerably shorter than what ewers story needed fully developed this makes the plot feel bit too vague times even incomplete there was something missing the narrative course there also the possibility that the existing print really incomplete however der student von prag very interesting early attempt complex tale horror and suspense film that while inferior what other filmmakers were doing the time left powerful impression history the direct predecessor the german expressionist movement hard deny the enormous importance that der student von prag has the history german cinema probably the history cinema general may look dated even for its time but considering the limited resources its director had truly better than most films from that era the movie that started paul wegener career and with that german expressionism der student von prag must see for everyone interested this slice film history
