t only that but what are the odds that the con men would the right spot the very night she decided show did they simply show that bar every night hoping she would come and see them another thing that had happen that couldn have been predicted that margaret had return see mike again and ask him teach her the tricks his trade what are the odds this happening and yet the whole con based this premise another problem had with the ending margaret finds out she been conned and decides get revenge mike first mamet leads believe that she going con the con but that falls through the ultimate ending her gunning mike down airport baggage area somehow that just felt like clumsy and inept way end movie about con artists plying their trade not only that but she didn even take back the money stole from her ultimately the movie leaves you feeling empty and unfulfilled and you like predicted ahead time that margaret was going conned you will find this revelation just unsatisfying
