s only help giggle and laugh them heck even the sets and some the wardrobe looks unfinished half assed granted once you accept that you are watching mixture moderate stop animation and miniatures well you can sort give the film and even enjoy the big robots kicking the hell out each other there are certain scenes when the robots are fighting that are kinda cool and made thats why liked thid movie but every know and them some crappy effect will take you right out that protective little cocoon you were trying hide and boom your right back into realizing this film just doesn live its premise and heres another thing that sort bothered bit about the movie this movie basically movie for kids you know giant robots duking out stop motion animation hello but this movies dialogue had lot sexual innuendos and the violence gets little bloody kept asking myself this kids movie not after while just came the conclusion that basically this was kids movie with adult sensibilities which really isn good mix for those you who don feel that certain naive childlike charm watching two robots fighting each other and you don have nostalgic connection this movie like well suggest you steer clear away from this one gordons great director but this movie made just didn for well least not now that full grown adult rating out
