1 |text the league gentlemen one the funniest strangest darkest and most unforgettable comedies our time much paved the way for more comedies its ilk many which have copied the style but have never succeeded unlike every other sketch show around the characters the league gentlemen are all loosely connected firstly they all live the fictional town royston vasey the back beyond northern england the first characters greet newcomers are tubbs and edwrad the pig faced owners supposedly local shop situated far away most the residents probably don know its existence other oddities include the denton family with obsession with hygiene chastity and toads hillary briss who sells special yet thankfully unknown brand meat pauline restart officer with sharp tongue and even sharper pens chinnery kind hearted vet and menace all things four legged geoff tipps plastics salesman with vicious sense humour often involving guns electric tubes and plums despite being comedy heart the league gentlemen often transcends genres whilst never appearing spoofing ripping off other people material there are several horror references such the disappearance hiker pair silent twins obsessive circus owner and sudden outbreak nosebleeds even more striking are moments when the series takes more sobre tone and aforementioned characters such pauline and geoff are shown more sympathetic vulnerable light the film adaptation the best demonstration this but some fans may decide they belong local the equally underrated third series also takes different route instead sketches each episode focuses individual character with each storyline leading one conclusion involving plastic bag and runaway theatre company van although many fans may not enjoy the structure the film the third series much the first two they certainly signs how inventive the league gentlemen can and how unafraid explore new areas short the league gentlemen definitely worth look like the welcome signs says you never leave
