1 |text director kinka usher stays true his own credo play straight and they will laugh and with the help superb cast has crafted what should become the cult film all time mystery men when evil villain casanova frankenstein geoffrey rush released from mental institution captures the local superhero captain amazing greg kinnear and threatens take over champion city three wanna superheroes furious ben stiller the shoveler william macy and the blue raja hank azaria come the rescue frankenstein has been joined myriad assortment underworld scum however and has become formidable opponent the trio realize that help needed and decide recruit what they end with nothing less than the most unforgettable team superheroes ever assembled the history the cinema furious has his rage the shoveler his shovel the blue raja flings silverware mainly forks and the occasional spoon but never knife the invisible boy kel mitchell can turn invisible long one watching the sphinx wes studi heavy hitter from down south very mysterious and can break guns half with his mind maybe the bowler janeane garofalo can fling ball with deadly accuracy and the spleen paul reubens wields flatulence that can incapacitate entire room this brilliant ensemble piece that delivers the laughs without ever becoming condescending patronizing the audience while playing straight all times the dialogue witty and the performances given stiller macy azaria and garofalo are exemplary there number memorable hilarious scenes especially the one which they throw pool party and barbecue recruit and conduct interviews with stupefying assemblage applicants and another bar when the bowler has conversation with her long dead father whose skull has been implanted her bowling ball the funniest all however has when the team actually attempts rescue captain amazing but these are only examples for the entire movie composed one hilarious scene after another laced with subtle humor that will keep you laughing and thinking about for long time the real secret success though that usher keeps all real the relationships between the characters are true and the whole concept being superhero played being entirely reasonable which somehow gives sense credibility the entire proceedings this world the aspirations furious and the rest are tenable and usher keeps the laughs coming without ever resorting slapstick mere sight gags the solid supporting cast includes lena olin annabel leek eddie izzard tony tom waits doc heller claire forlani monica louise lasser the blue raja mother jenifer lewis lucille and pras tony mystery men truly inspired movie that can seen over and over again with new chuckle had with every viewing guaranteed the immortal words the sphinx are number one all others are number two lower oscar worthy movie hardly but for good time and lot laughs treat yourself this masterwork comedy the real deal and you won regret rate this one
