alking around fluorescent green outfits and makeup being photographed special lighting make her look like glowing ghost the cinematographer deserves some credit for creative lighting but compare the dull visual effects blithe spirit the truly groundbreaking effects disney song the south which was eligible for awards the same year south humans and animated characters share the screen seamlessly for minutes time compared south the oscar that blithe spirit received for special effects was completely undeserved any rate can only encourage you catch the broadway revival this play with angela lansbury before closes for the movie with rex harrison skip
