1 |text this superbly imaginative low budget sci movie from cult director vincenzo natali the film plays out like crossing phillip dick with hitchcock and cronenberg and the film takes unique feel like nothing you would have seen the film superbly shot love the cinematography this feels fresh and original plot wise the film explores similar themes films like total recall dark city and the matrix and its pretty staple sci stuff morgan sullivan jeremy northam suburbanite who bored with his life and has decided take job company spy for digicorp large technological corporation meets with recruitment officer the beginning who brings sullivan board and instructs him what has basically involves going conferences rival companies and recording them via satellite transmission device disguised pen also means that must take different persona and keep secret from his wife after his first job things become strange his habits change his personality begins differ and suffers pains his neck and headaches well nightmares encounters beautiful woman named rita foster played intriguingly cast lucy liu takes instant attraction however when goes his next job and sees her again she reveals herself agent some sort who reveals that his job not quite what seems finds out later that and the rest the people attending the conference all work for digicorp the conferences are all covers allow the company men brainwash their spies sullivan whose alternate name jack thursby has been given antidote digicorps drugging and while the rest the spies the latest conference drift off into what seems like brain dead day dream while the speakers drone the speakers send all the attendants sleep via subliminal messages suddenly the rooms lights turn off and workers digicorp come shining lights all the occupants eyes ensure they are not conscious and then fairly nightmarish situation they bring head sets for each member which send messages into the brain and brainwash the precipitants into believing they are someone else digicorp are using these people puppets and creating personalities and lives for these people while wiping their own existence sullivan now must pretend that entirely believes now jack thursby digicorp want steal information from their rivals samways and they want their own puppets they now effectively control what these spies except for sullivan when samways get hold sullivan and discover has not actually been brainwashed they decide use him pawn spy digicorp make sullivan double agent they know that digicorp have sent thursby them work his way into samways and work his way the system until can get into situation download important company information that could shut the company down samways realises had been planted and decide they will play along with digicorp and allow thursby infiltrate their databanks but they will give digicorp dodgy disc that will ruin their system the plot begins twist and turn both companies are using sullivan pawn stuck the middle and rita foster mystery tries work out why she helping him when mysterious third party becomes involved the person revealed that foster works for sullivan must decide whether this freelance agent who could guarantee him new life and safety stick with one the companies works for the tension all builds stonking climax seems just about everyone wants dispose him once his usefulness has expires the cast are great northam superb and the subtlety his performance excellent brings great visual aspect his performance his eyes tell story and see great subtle change his character changes from sullivan thursby lucy liu just sexy beyond belief and her presence gives great dynamic the film because seems strange casting but works because that fact the rest the cast are also good director natali whose previous film was the cult classic sci flick cube has real visual flair paces the film superbly well and has given great look for low budget film features some imaginative visual effects and although the cgi isn great never begins too much centre piece effect the film negatively the film really does bring feelings the matrix and other great sci films there with them the plot nearly becomes too convoluted times but truth that helps film like this that where the cronenberg and lynch influence evident the film has you constantly working out what going and genuinely surprises goes along this overall obvious cult classic and can see this being incredibly popular when released the states
