1 |text this brilliant sci movie that very strange how men and women both view the same film have talked many people about the film and almost every guy loved and said was brilliant while most women thought was just disgusting and stupid this the only movie know that has such polarized views based gender perhaps many women just have lower tolerance for disgusting depressing plots but whatever the cause have always found this difference fascinating the film begins with murder and subsequent investigation headed charlton heston this set the near future and the head the huge international soylent corporation has been assassinated the film unfolds you quickly realize this terrible and highly inequitable future american society the rich live gorgeous apartments with security and all the pleasures money can buy including furniture euphemism for paid mistresses that come along with the apartment the same time the masses are dirt poor unemployed and many cases living abandoned cars apartment hallways overpopulation and smog have taken severe toll and the future looks awful indeed why the rich man died and the awful truth could not live with really should not discuss could ruin the film for you however the film has great plot and acting and super exciting watch plus features edward robinson his final screen performance the crusty sidekick heston though not for the easily depressed squeamish this great sci film that allegorical and profound
