ents would have experienced ourselves and sometimes serve throwback our own recollection childhood short those scenes screamed fun observe the life typical kampung where some neighbours are very nice while others the nosy parkers and rumour mongers spreading ill gossip stemming from envy there are additional family dynamics seen one from immediate neighbour and the other from mukhsin own both which serve adequate subplots and contrast orked own always yasmin movies are filled with excellent music and for mukhsin has something special the song hujan penned her father well quitte pas aptly used the movie given that the yasmin movies date have been centred around the same characters the beauty that you can watch them stand alone when watched and pieced together makes compelling family drama dealing with separate themes and universal issues like interracial romance love and forgiveness fans will definitely see the many links mukhsin back the earlier movies while new audiences will surely curious find out certain whys and significance recurring characters events like that pudgy boy who steals glances orked and speaking whys parts mukhsin too curiously open which probably distinctive yasmin style deliberately left such thought that story about childhood recollected from memory then there are details which will left out for sure and subtly felt that mukhsin exhibited this perfectly with not detailed details and the focus what can remembered significant episodes between the two another highly recommended movie and rare one that feel suitable for all ages bring along your kid brother sister
