n refuse see the literal writing the wall the never ending war explodes christmas eve the little boy wanting good soldier like his daddy image that will likely always stay with this the world 1936 that wore blinders hitler appeasement this war does not end the poison gas the aerial wars segues into the second act another dark age government services and people carried along and cheering the war that one remembers anything about plague warlords and bullying get the planes flying for fuel that longer exists loved ones are shot the street before they can carry the plague another midway there marvelous vignette about the rolls royce that much needed respite mid way into this lands futuristic plane that heralds the future that future the third act the world has rebuilt itself with the help that puny animal man helicopters fly this film before they were even invented the plumber helper has other uses than the dalek glenn miller wide screen plasma screens beguiling the masses and orators inciting the people tear all down beware the concussion you have been warned the city father warns the riotous populace warned this film might hit you like hit there are some cute miscues and miscalculations but the thought provoking idealism what really worth pondering again and want see this artful film again others criticize wells vision very easy work with hindsight regarding things costumes and foley miscues believe wells things come not about things but actually about concepts social trends and philosophical ideals besides are now just beginning the new millennium and are not the time still come this not cheap cardboard british science fiction but worthwhile epic filmed opera sans singing that whole concept overcomes some minor dated shortcomings
