utes into the film barjatya may think returning his maine pyar kiya roots with vivah but truth that the reason embraced salman and bhagyashree that film even salman and madhuri hum aapke hain koun because they had such fantastic chemistry because although they were created out the same mould shahid and amrita vivah those pairs had mischief and masti shahid and amrita are just insipid and boring for film that relies heavily music narrate its story the filmmaker chooses string 70s style tunes that only further slacken the film deadening pace but had choose just one reason explain why vivah doesn work for because not sure can relate any the characters who inhabit barjatya story some perhaps vivah will give hope that perfect world like this actually out there somewhere but little cynical guess give the coquettish madhuri hum aapke hain kaun give the bratty salman maine pyar kiya even take that mischievous karisma kapoor hum saath saath hain but save from these dullards you know some marriages aren made heaven this one vivah
