1 |text first all don into revolver expecting another snatch lock stock this different sort gangster film saw the gala the other night and this movie definitely split the audience the kind movie where half the audience will leave thinking what was that that was awful and the other half will leave thinking what was that that was cool personally like films that don understand mullholland drive and usual suspects enjoyed revolver definitely wasn perfect though saw the big twist coming mile away least part and though sometimes some loose ends left unexplained good revolver leaves lot questions unexplained for reason seemed also some scenes like the animation and the scene where sorter goes killing spree actually one favourites although awesome scenes watch seemed just there because they were awesome watch not because they fit with the movie however there were many good things too thought the acting was superb from all the main actors jason stratham ray liotta vincent pastore and even andre benjamin who was pleasant surprise this movie definitely kept interest with one great suspenseful action packed scene after another when ray liotta was being held under the table wow well you have see the script was extremely well done and the soundtrack with most guy ritchie films was great though step below such movies fight club mullholland drive and usual suspects was still awesome fast paced psychological action movie with many twists and turns and tons scenes you will remember long after the movie over
