ch hand called candy david canary who became their fourth member the cast but candy was never featured any gunfights and was hardly more than older version little joe for year two they also had ben take some other lost cousin jamie played the forgettable mitch vogel who was teenager that was usually getting into some kind trouble with someone apparently adding the teenager the studio was looking attract younger viewers also gave the writers chance write episodes about teenage problems alcohol delinquency etc those kind preachy episodes were popular the 1960s reaction the establishment media the counter culture movement dragnet was probably the most popular source law and order though hawaii the and many other shows also tried jump the bandwagon doing shows that featured irresponsible teenagers causing mischief mayhem and crime the addition teenager the cast gave the cartwrights more chances show and solve problems but those episodes feel very contrived and are not very good general after dan blocker died the series limped along for another year before was canceled the last season was pretty bad featured little joe tracking down the killers his wife and most the episodes were somewhat depressing because little joe was usually drinking otherwise remembering how much loved his wife and how unfair was that she was killed don think have ever seen the last episode the series and wonder they ever officially wrapped some way the last year there was only ben lorne greene actually living the ponderosa adam had moved away and never came back even once guest and hoss had died and little joe had left after his wife the series had been killed drifters overall the era from 1959 1965 the best this series once adam left slowly declined most the shows before 1970 are pretty good too 1970 the series was trying hard hip and topical and had lost lot its western flavor the addition candy and the teenage kid also diluted the general quality the show and the death hoss dan blocker was the final nail bonanza probably the best western series ever made and the 465 episodes that were produced least one hundred them are excellent western drama that pretty good record even the worst bonanza better than lot other shows
