1 |text based fact this the story teenager named homer hickam jake gyllenhaal growing coal town west virginia where boy usual destiny was end the mines but homer had his eye the sky and love for flying rockets the dismay his mine foreman father and the consternation the townsfolk generally misfit for sure and three his equally outcast buddies begin making rockets which they fly from patch barren land eight miles out town longer terrorize the community with their oft times errant rockets unfortunately most the town and especially homer father chris cooper thinks that they are wasting their time however the people become intrigued and soon start coming out droves watch the rocketboys send off their homemade missiles only one teacher laura dern the high school understands their efforts and lets them know that they could become contenders the national science fair with college scholarships being the prize now the gang must learn perfect their craft and overcome the many problems facing them they shoot for the stars director joe johnston has always been famous name for his movies such jumanji jurassic park october sky surely stands above all his other films without any doubts october sky his best effort obviously his best film not only true story filmed extremely well but even movie has every single thing which required for top level cinema and along with johnston extra ordinary direction are some exceptional performances jake gyllenhaal was around when this movie was released gives beautiful natural performance perfect actor chris cooper his father also gives very fine performance the same goes for laura dern also she looks beautiful even the rest the performances are extremely well the background score was fine highly inspiring movie which lifts your spirit sky high one those movies which definitely inspires you for all your life amazing inspiring movie along with loads entertainment not missed
