1 |text basically the exact same movie house wax vincent price first genuine horror hit released the previous year but seriously who cares because the mad magician offers just many sheer thrills delightful period set pieces joyous effects sublime acting performances and macabre horror gimmicks its predecessor never change winning team exactly what writer crane wilbur must have thought when penned down price character don gallico another tormented soul besieged fate and out for vengeance against those who wronged him don gallico about perform his very first own illusionist show gallico the great and plans exhibit the greatest magic trick history entitled the girl and the buzz saw gallico promising solo career abruptly ruined before even begins when his previous employer ross ormond appears stage and shoves contract under his nose stating that all gallico inventions are the rightful property the company the sleazy and relentless ormond who the way also ransacked gallico once beloved wife takes off with the buzz saw trick and programs the show gallico rival the great rinaldi inevitably gallico snaps and sadistically butchers ormond but xc2 x96 also being master creating disguises xc2 x96 recreates his victim image and even starts leading double life the mad magician amusing and thoroughly unpretentious horror movie grand guignol style with whole lot improbably plot twists the landlady turns out brilliant crime novelist and handful fantastically grotesque gross out moments although they obviously remain suggestive for most part the delights near the beginning the film like player and goofy trick with water fountains merely just serve time filler and contemporary hype but still fun watch even now and without the means properly behold them the mad magician also interesting from periodical setting point view the events take place around the time fingerprints were starting get used evidence material and the character alice prentiss obvious reference towards famous crime authors that era needless state that vincent price remains the absolute most essential element triumph this film well from nearly every other horror movie this legendary man ever starred like other actor could ever accomplish price depicts the tormented protagonist who gradually descends further and further into mental madness such indescribably mesmerizing way you pity don gallico yet the same time you fear him enormously you support his vile acts retaliation and yet simultaneously you realize his murderous rampage must end death vincent price simply was genius actor and humble opinion the embodiment the horror genre
