pson catherine cahn kicking out hackenstein keeping melanie behind yolanda back who seemingly oblivious what happening with touch gore but say hackenstein more comedy than horror conception feel throughout there are some tacky puns sexual innuendo well which are always good for laugh hackenstein wendy would you like see instruments example also thought the scene when mrs trilling phyllis diller reports her missing daughter the bemused detective olin william schreiner was pretty amusing sequence going round circle talking about why isn looking for them even though has only just been told why the cell doesn have prisoner that didn find the cousin not worry about none flat laugh out loud but must admit found myself smiling occasion found the film whole quietly amusing there isn lot screen gore few severed limbs sheila decapitated head some medical stitching those skinned animals which are definitely fake the way liked the characters hackenstein too which was surprise itself the acting isn brilliant but give everyone credit they put some effort into lots exaggerated facial movements some serious overacting means never dull the three birds hackenstein are fit you know what mean technically the film well once again ain going win any oscars but have give the filmmakers least some credit for trying pull off turn the century period setting doesn always work the clothes are odds with each other times the girls look like their from victorian england while the guys look like their from western the house looks all the filmmakers did was remove any modern object from the room stick few candles there comes across little bit the cheap side but really isn bad looking film all considering could have done without the comedy music though overall ended enjoying hackenstein much more than thought would although that itself isn recommendation certainly not the best comedy horror film ever made certainly not the worst either watchable enough piece harmless fun
