ose who became annoyed the number xc2 x91scream 1996 clones from the late nineties may very well find this refreshing change did seldom dull and generally well paced script well some proficient direction helps make xc2 x91the dentist one the more pleasurable cheesy horrors from the 1990 top this are presented with some particularly grizly and the whole realistic scenes dental torture which should keep most gorehounds happy far from perfect but far from bad well xc2 x91the dentist flick that easily worth watching least once rating for xc2 x91the dentist xc2 x96
