1 |text this film has over the past ten years become one favorite pseudo noir experiences the three storyline threads given kazan each have their unique and separate pleasures the domestic chitchat between bel geddes and widmark the movement between rooms the small gestures such the phone book barbara places the chair under her son can reach the table those small intimate exchanges between husband and wife all are well crafted and natural more than anything else love their porch that second living room where clear they spend much their summer time the second thread the professional relationship between many the film but especially between widmark and douglas characters may not totally original and does get bit blustery but all all comes across real respectful and efficient the third thread the grungy tale blackie and his tattered little gang gets closest dark and frightening noir world palance blackie cold block ice this self proclaimed business man this self made man clearly has complexity only briefly tap for this film continues completely satisfying experience
