1 |text future society the military component does not have recruit rather their candidates are chosen birth culled from nurseries and designated spend their entire lives the service the government they are given over the war machine body and soul for reason other than protect and serve they have personal identity other than name and rank and autonomy whatsoever this the fate those whose destiny predetermined for them soldier directed paul anderson and starring kurt russell the scenario hard and bleak the movie begins depicting the training the soldiers during advancing periods time from preadolescence adulthood russell sergeant todd the best the best and glimpse his career discharges his duties exemplary manner campaign after campaign what was born soldier but even the best cannot forever and the day arrives when todd and his peers are longer the elite new generation soldiers has been created products advanced genetics and technology and todd generation suddenly obsolete what follows the story man who must fight for his life while struggling discover his own sense humanity and individuality traits new soldier who has known only two things his entire life fear and discipline russell gives commanding performance todd the soldier who above all else must obey orders without question while suppressing all emotion and individual thoughts has few lines this movie but russell speaks volumes with his eyes this role demonstrates that fact one the under appreciated actors our times that can disappear entirely into the character todd credit his ability and with this part has created someone quite different from any done before and given todd depth and credibility that someone lesser talent could easily have rendered nothing more than pretentious and superficial stereotype notable performances are also turned here connie nielsen sandra and jason isaacs colonel mekum rounding out the supporting cast are jason scott lee memorable caine 607 one the new generation soldiers sean pertwee mace gary busey captain church michael chiklis jimmy pig and mark bringleson rubrick anderson has delivered action film with message cautionary tale that transcends the genre science fiction soldier reminds the importance keeping the humanity our lives intact entertaining way making consider the alternatives like bleak future and world which good movies just wouldn make whole lot difference much like 1984 and mad max this movie which ultimately uplifting going make you take pause and think about the kind universe which all must live together and share rate this one
