1 |text some the best movies that are categorized comedies actually blur between comedy and drama the graduate and butch cassidy and the sundance kid which were made also the late 1960 are perfect examples are they comedies with dramatic undertones dramas with lot humor many respects the odd couple falls into this same category being both comedy yet highly dramatic with deep underpinnings about human nature much what happens may funny the audience but the characters are not laughing despite the rather light hearted show the 1970 the original odd couple not merely about neat guy and messy guy who are forced live together because their marital situation really about two opposites who must face why their marriages fell apart and how their detrimental idiosyncrasies reveal themselves outside their marriage neatness the characteristic felix ungar jack lemon perfectly cast and messiness the characteristic oscar madison walter matthau are only the beginning and somewhat superficial the story unfolds find there lot more these men than simply neatness versus messiness briefly the story really about felix ungar who has face impending divorce from his wife francis who never meet but important character throughout the story the verge suicide ungar goes the only place knows the apartment oscar madison where group poker buddies hang out every often learn that ungar not only member this poker club but the group knows what happening him and try their inept way help out madison figures the best way help ungar let him move with him until his suicidal tendencies wear off unfortunately for madison doesn know what getting himself into madison carefree happy lucky rather irresponsible slob who refrigerator was last cleaned probably when herbert hoover was still the white house madison idea serving snacks grabbing moldy cheese and sticking them between two pieces bread and then throwing the contents bag chips the table the other hand enjoys booze and women short having good time ungar not only altogether different diametrically opposite not only obsessive neatness nut that finds more joy disinfecting the apartment than meeting women but knows more than most women about cooking and fine eating one point calls his wife not talk about reconciling but get her recipe for meatloaf another moment ungar was going spend the rest the evening cutting cabbage for coleslaw when madison seems unimpressed ungar finally confesses was only doing for his roommate because can stand coleslaw who this guy but has another endearing trait felix also hypochondriac obsesses about his health the point where makes strange noises public places claiming helping his sinuses seems have every health condition the book and they made more felix would probably have them ultimately overly self absorbed running throughout the movie are references marriage one point when madison trying convince ungar move says what you want wedding ring but little does know that not the neat guy who can deal with the messy guy but the other way around their friendship becomes inadvertent hellish relationship and the climax occurs when oscar invites two lonely british sisters for get together with both comedic and tragic results this one the best comedies its type ever written and not missed with superlative performances walter matthau and jack lemon roles that are hard imagine better played anyone else unfortunate that writing this caliber sadly lacking from most comedies being produced today
