imple slimeball first take him for though his intentions may just possessive the fianc xc3 xa9 warning spoilers below the film has many fine set pieces including lucienne triumph the miss europe contest shown through the comic reactions assorted audience members who wind pelting the heroine with flowers her misery housewife peeling potatoes while the pendulum the cuckoo clock marks time behind her nightmarish trip fun fair the silent version this occurs late the film after her marriage which lucienne crushed among the low lifes and depressed her husband macho antics decides that she can with her present existence and especially the final scene the projection room where she views her talkie screen test louise brooks may never have looked more beautiful than she does here with the projector beam flickering her alabaster profile her shoulders swathed white fur her face incandescent under the black helmet hair she watches herself singing screen the double shot her exquisite corpse and her still living image the screen particularly poignant louise brooks image like lucienne remains immortal despite her frustratingly aborted film career
