n the group started the final editing process there are always both sides the story and here have only one course one would expect anton does not approve the final result and sees this movie betrayal his former friends second the film very dandy warhols biased sure the winner takes all but the fact that courtney taylor leader narrates even though seems good choice provides feeling seemingly closer involvement and that bands late history represented nonproportionally bjm covered till 1997 and till 2003 does not add objectivity the film third the movie somewhat shallow what does want teach one critic said movie examines old questions where does genius fit into commodified world can thrive and get its due does need self destruct preserve its integrity does not examine these questions just depicts story brilliant but unsuccessful musician narrated less brilliant but successful one who indulges self assurance and eternal coolness ego greater than mountain anyway the movie was fun raw fresh stylish just god damn interesting least for the bjm fans for the rest the crowd don know
