-1 |text scooby doo undoubtedly one the most simple successful and beloved cartoon characters the world what happens when you been everywhere and done everything with the formula you switch right wrong you stop production and let rest for decade and then run again keeping the core its success intact that say stick with the formula for the most part but add your particular flavour this why what new scooby doo worked they want back the classic scooby doo formula which had only successfully resurfaced decade earlier pup named scooby doo but for the most part had not been tapped since the original scooby doo where are you the first sign weak offering the inclusion extraneous characters there might few fond memories from past iterations but generally you think scooby doo you aren thinking film flam scrappy doo scooby dum even worse the exclusion the other core members mystery inc generally indicate group production people who don understand from kids point view how the show works the basic premise has always been group people who are diametrically opposed getting together and through their own individual stereotyped qualities manage surmount the tasks given hand this next paragraph just theorizing skip you want hope that can explain why think fiddling around with the basic elements the show are detrimental with interpretation what the gang represents and how they contribute the whole fred represents the driver think general the purpose fred give the group direction organization and sub tasks fred isn happy lucky teenager your boss your teacher your dad your authority figure fred moves without hesitation and driven tasks problem always equals solution for fred many ways fred the antithesis shaggy shaggy your best friend that guy who just little more afraid things than you are enables you brave not the back the pack shaggy represents emotion and frequently showing emotional extremes from elation fear velma represents rational thought she applies logic but see time and again the show she requires clues that for the most part are collected pieces the other members the show left her own would velma solve mystery the group often finds itself situations where truths aren obvious and only through chance encounters they achieve the necessary information complete their task chance represented daphne one point think the first scooby doo series she was known danger prone writers have used daphne link unrelated events together through accident she frequently the one who finds the secret door collection objects some other detail that can help the gang link clues together finally scooby himself represents the participant always the centre events capable all the things the rest the gang are capable yet handicapped because not human and much like the television viewer unable truly participate scooby doo works because all these personified elements problem solving are immediately identifiable and entertaining maybe over thinking things but life seen lot scooby doo being year old self proclaimed nerd kind rolls with the territory there magic with the classic scooby doo formula that should never messed with many have pointed out scooby doo not great work art nor completely trite falls into the category programming that can watched young eyes with hearty bowl breakfast cereal messing about with the raw simplicity transforms into something else something lesser
