1 |text although live minnesota have been studying france lately and came across this bizarre gem film this movie was amazing say the least creative and unique film the different directors each lent something different their interpretation love the city light the first instinct attempt fit each one these little stories into overall storyline much can done with 2003 love actually this attempt however renders the magic each individual segment obsolete when taken face value with each the short segments taken its own individual film the love stories together tell beautiful message the film strikingly bizarre times often the point confusion and each individual segment can hard follow still watcher who pays close attention each the segments the short plot lines become clear after short time the confusion almost intriguing keeps you the edge your seat waiting for what will come next leaves the viewer wondering did that really just happen yet also leaves them satisfied that did indeed occur the kind movie where the viewer upon leaving the theater can actually decide whether they loved they hated the initial reaction and watch again and again just see these individual lives blend together into cinematic masterpiece the interesting decision make the movie multilingual adds something the spectrum people who can relate adds the reality the film here the american tourists speak english the parisians french and the number people that the film encompasses leads understanding the international language love from sickness the supernatural the love parents the love husbands this film covers all the bases romantic storytelling its beautiful and quirky way each unique event somehow falls into place tell story that all types sizes nationalities and shapes love
