d then hung upside down the fireplace and accidentally slow roasted the rest the cast there also crucifixion witches eating dead baby swordfish through the head someone set fire possession sesame street tape recorder the virgin getting raped some demon guys veins bulging and exploding thanks voodoo doll pokes and some other stuff from technical standpoint nice looking film with pretty good cinematography decent score and good gore effects the hotel island setting also pretty nice blair particularly the end and ross both seem like they having fun and knef great the evil witch even though people like ridicule hasselhoff these days not bad his role either the down side despite all the gore the film seems somewhat dull and gets monotonous after about hour the supernatural themes are muddled and confusing too when characters are being swept into the witches lair tortured and killed the filmmakers unwisely decided superimpose the screaming actors over some silly looking red spiral vortex effect that looks supremely cheesy and the witch lair itself vacant and cheaply designed with unfinished lumber and while most the cast least decent few the performances particularly the actress who plays hasselhoff girlfriend and the kid are bad they constantly distracting
