y the bfg the only character that imaginatively animated sophie lacks appeal and the giants are boringly designed and look almost indistinguishable from each other even the places are uninventive giant country especially comes short being nothing more than barren wasteland with occasional rocks and canyons minutes the film not exactly lengthy yet drags quite badly parts due the soporific handling several sequences little dahl mischievous humour conveyed satisfactorily one chapter the book deals with the bfg love whizzpopping farting and laugh out loud hilarious the film the same section totally killed unfunny handling came the the bfg expecting lots zest fun and enjoyment but what got was pretty much the opposite this one failed misfire that simply doesn match the calibre the book any department unfortunately therefore must down one skip
