morable taut and exciting thriller thanks fine performances tight direction john sturges the crisp monochrome cinematography victor milner and atmospheric score dimitri tiomkin extras however are great shakes except for radio version jeopardy and trailers for both movies this disc also part barbara stanwyck box set celebrating her centenary hard believe that the lady would over 100 years old she was still around jeopardy mgm winner
