open him the reality what happened and what the future holds always edge and ready snap any moment when something mentioned spark the memory his perished family goes through life with his ipod and headphones shutting out everything not tempted remember reign over not about charlie fineman though about dentist and family man alan johnson man that has trapped himself into marriage and dental practice that both have stagnated into monotony johnson needs much help his life his old college roommate charlie does played perfectly the always brilliant don cheadle johnson has lost his backbone try and change his life has friends and when sees charlie chance one day his life evolves into something hasn felt years revels the chance out with old friend matter how much has changed from the death his family cheadle character wants revert back the college days hanging out and sandler doesn mind because all that was before met his wife the two men get what they want and allow themselves grow close despite the years solitude that used rule their lives once they begin opening though inevitable that the subject the tragedy will creep and test the xc3 xa7ade they have created for themselves the supporting cast does amazing job helping keep appearances for the two leads jada pinkett smith has never been actress that impressed and throughout the film played the tough nails wife nicely but her final scene the phone with cheadle that really showed something different and true liv tyler bit out her element psychiatrist but the movie calls her this fact and makes the miscasting perfect casting the many small cameos are also effective even writer director mike binder role sandler old best friend and accountant only gripe here why feels the need put his name the opening credits actor when everywhere considering his film last but not least the beautiful saffron burrows she great actress and plays the love crushed divorc xc3 xa9e trying put her life back together wonderfully role that seems comic relief first but ends being integral aspect for what come binder has crafted one the best dramatic character studies have seen long time the direction almost flawless the blurring between cuts and characters the fore background really annoyed the beginning the acting superb and the story true itself never taking the easy way out wrapping itself with neatly tied bow the conclusion even the music was fantastic and used enhance not lead emotionally why after two great uses the titular song the who did binder feel the need use the inferior eddie veddar remake for the end don know but did unfortunately stick out for reign over film about love and how although can cause the worst pain imaginable can also save from regret and allow once again see the world place beauty and hope
