down the exposed inoculate them and contain the disease while there plenty suspense during these two moods much the film also fairly straightforward drama with pacing more typical that genre the dialogue throughout excellent the stylistic difference many modern films could hardly more pronounced intelligent delivered quickly and well enunciated each character conflict isn created dumb decisions but smart moves events and characters actions are more like chess game when unusual stances are taken such reed withholding the plague from the newspapers gives relatively lengthy justifications for his decisions which other characters argue over light this interesting that kazan believed that propriety religion ethics and the middle class are all murdering that idea works its way into the film through the alterations the norm allowances away from made the protagonists for example head gangster blackie jack palance his first film role offered get out jail free card cooperate with combating the plague the technical aspects the film are fine nothing exceptional but the real reasons watch are the performances the intriguing scenario and the well written dialogue
