1 |text 2054 paris escher drawing with people and vehicles scurrying along multiple levels obvious homage fritz lang metropolis paris both ultramodern and crumbling into decay and the blink between surveillance sweeps pretty young medical researcher kidnapped just after leaving her sister seedy nightclub tough police captain investigates shown stark black and white with the gloomy corridors shadowy alleys and single source lighting characteristic the most hard boiled film noir comparisons sin city are inevitable but the story owes more masamune shirow and william gibson than frank miller high tech surveillance near invisible stealth suits and ruthless super corporations are much part the landscape guns and cars the film never quite generates the doom laden atmosphere gibson cyberpunk vision with its tech heavy marginal characters clashing with industrial types from corporations that all seem have their own ministry fear but the viewer definitely gets the sense that future paris utopia and future science less than benevolent and the police procedural plot line unfolds are taken into the darker recesses individual ambition beneath the shiny veneer avalon corporation cultivated image the motion capture process used here produces look somewhere between comic books and next generation rotoscoping and either captivating intrusive depending your tastes nevertheless great visual sense display here and future paris filled down the tiny details giving the picture unique look which turns both spartan and baroque worth look
