tely crosses the line don like talk crap about artist work john huston was man that did not know and sure was sincere and gifted filmmaker which his respected place film history attests views are clearly skewed having read and loved flannery connor work don claim coming from any other perspective maybe stand alone film works for cinephiles but for flannery connor fans and might add for self respecting southerners and openminded individuals all stripes this movie waste time
