er keep the family together olympia dukakis only seen the end the film she makes good contribution the fleeing mother elizabeth perkins plays rachel with great style the film has beautiful look thanks the cinematography dan gillham and the excellent musical score steven argila ultimately the film shows great team effort between its director defelitta and paul reiser who wrote for the screen although this film clearly targeted for older audience should please anyone
