1 |text this comedy with much underlying pain and sadness succeeds where most others fail there have been many films this genre with more notable actors attempting achieve this elusive mixture which haven come anywhere near the depth and deftness this one this surely because the exceptional cast with outstanding performances reg rogers and ally sheedy seem spontaneous that the reality their characters rapidly grip your interest and emotions and hold them throughout the film first the action seems rather off the wall and harebrained but one gradually learns that these two rather pathetic damaged people are desperately and unwillingly trying heal themselves even grudgingly through each other rogers heartrending facial expressions numb hurt and sheedy angry outbursts are eloquent that one feels them one observes them you will care about these two likable but deeply suffering people and hope that they will succeed because doubt and all hangs tenuous emotional thread hopefully audiences will get see more reg rogers and ally sheedy this film proves their merit very accomplished actors beyond doubt
