1 |text lot the comments people have made strike sorry missing the point kasdan wants present life simply ordinary life the conventionally structured story where characters have insights that change their lives and then fade out music and the film over absorbed into this much larger canvas several characters this movie have just such illuminations and then they move sometimes they can hold onto their insights sometimes they can and that the way life really other words kasdan jettisons conventional dramatic structure favor exploration the the ongoingness life xc2 x96 there happy ending only eventual ending and everything before that still process still always for grabs xc2 x96 and you absolutely insist theme exploration the role the miraculous our lives what miracle well life itself for start then add all the random incidents and cross connections that make life several interconnected lives and you have miracles the bucketful kasdan underscores this theme lightly rather than insisting and bolsters various ways most memorably the device right the center the film having mac and his wife lying bed each dreaming their own dreams but well showing later the film how those dreams have the power within the film shape reality this not film with easy obvious message you just have let play out front you and then let sit your mind for few days month few years and see what has wrought there this without doubt kasdan best film his most mature his most humane major meditation life from one our most gifted writers and directors the tragedy course that has not been allowed work for number years now mostly due studio constraints around dreamcatcher hopefully haven heard the last from larry kasdan great film from great artist keep mind that art does not have rationalize itself completely order succeed
